{
  "page": 446,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3789,
      "text": "Demi (rombongan malaikat) yang berbaris bersaf-saf,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3790,
      "text": "demi (rombongan) yang mencegah dengan sungguh-sungguh,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3791,
      "text": "demi (rombongan) yang membacakan peringatan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3792,
      "text": "sungguh, Tuhanmu benar-benar Esa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3793,
      "text": "Tuhan langit dan bumi serta apa yang berada di antara keduanya, dan Tuhan tempat-tempat terbitnya matahari.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3794,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah menghias langit dunia (yang terdekat) dengan hiasan bintang-bintang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3795,
      "text": "Dan (Kami) telah menjaganya dari setiap setan yang durhaka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3796,
      "text": "Mereka (setan-setan itu) tidak dapat mendengar (pembicaraan) para malaikat dan mereka dilempari dari segala penjuru,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3797,
      "text": "untuk mengusir mereka, dan mereka akan mendapat azab yang kekal,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3798,
      "text": "kecuali (setan) yang mencuri (pembicaraan); maka ia dikejar oleh bintang yang menyala.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3799,
      "text": "Maka tanyakanlah kepada mereka (musyrik Mekkah), \"Apakah penciptaan mereka yang lebih sulit ataukah apa[726] yang telah Kami ciptakan?\" Sesungguhnya Kami telah menciptakan mereka dari tanah liat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3800,
      "text": "Bahkan engkau (Muhammad) menjadi heran (terhadap keingkaran mereka) dan mereka menghinakan (engkau).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3801,
      "text": "Dan apabila mereka diberi peringatan, mereka tidak mengindahkannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3802,
      "text": "Dan apabila mereka melihat suatu tanda (kebesaran) Allah, mereka memperolok-olokan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3803,
      "text": "Dan mereka berkata, \"Ini tidak lain hanyalah sihir yang nyata.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3804,
      "text": "Apabila kami telah mati dan telah menjadi tanah dan tulang-belulang, apakah benar kami akan dibangkitkan (kembali)?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3805,
      "text": "Dan apakah nenek moyang kami yang telah terdahulu (akan dibangkitkan pula)?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3806,
      "text": "Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Ya, dan kamu akan terhina.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3807,
      "text": "Maka sesungguhnya kebangkitan itu hanya dengan satu teriakan saja; maka seketika itu mereka melihatnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3808,
      "text": "Dan mereka berkata, \"Alangkah celaka kami! (Kiranya) inilah hari pembalasan itu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3809,
      "text": "Inilah hari keputusan[727] yang dahulu kamu dustakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3810,
      "text": "(Diperintahkan kepada malaikat), \"Kumpulkanlah orang-orang yang zalim beserta teman sejawat mereka dan apa yang dahulu mereka sembah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3811,
      "text": "selain Allah, lalu tunjukkanlah kepada mereka jalan ke nereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3812,
      "text": "Tahanlah mereka (di tempat perhentian), sesungguhnya mereka akan ditanya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
